{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"wolf","model_identifier":"wolf","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# wolf\n\nWolf (B6), grey forest wolf, 0.8 m at the shoulder (28.5 u incl. fur), about 1.6 m nose to tail.\n\nLean body (deep chest, narrow waist), dark saddle along the back, pale legs and muzzle, separate jaw, pointed ears, long bushy two-bone tail. A collar cube around the neck is painted as fur in the default texture and as a bead and leather collar in `wolf_runkin`.\n\n- Cubes: 25 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -4.6..4.6, y 0.0..31.5, z -30.0..21.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- body box 8 x 29 x 40 (w x h x d) centred on x = 0, z = -4, from y = 0 (head to z = -30, tail to z = 21)\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3.2 | loop | breathing, looking around |\n| `walk` | 0.8 | loop | 4-beat walk |\n| `trot` | 0.5 | loop | diagonal trot (the travelling gait) |\n| `run` | 0.34 | loop | full gallop, head low |\n| `bite` | 0.8 | once | key 0.32 s: jaws snap shut at full lunge (about 6 u forward); crouch 0.15 s, open 0.26 s |\n| `sit` | 3 | loop | sitting, looking around (loop); howl starts and ends in this pose |\n| `howl` | 3 | once | from sitting: head up 0.6 s, mouth open 1.0-2.2 s (the howl), back to sitting at 3.0 s |\n| `injured` | 0.6 | once | flinch back |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | falls onto its right side, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 49.8 u/s (1.4 m/s), cycle 0.8 s, 40 u per cycle\n- `trot`: 113.8 u/s (3.2 m/s), cycle 0.5 s, 57 u per cycle\n- `run`: 320.0 u/s (9.0 m/s), cycle 0.34 s, 109 u per cycle\n\n## Key times\n\n- `bite`: key 0.32 s: jaws snap shut at full lunge (about 6 u forward); crouch 0.15 s, open 0.26 s\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `wolf_runkin.png`: Runkin friendly wolf: same fur plus a leather collar with red and bone-white beads\n- `wolf_young.png`: young texture (use at half scale): pup, softer and lighter, bigger-looking eyes\n\n## Notes\n\n- Variant file names: wolf_runkin.png (the brief's `wolf_runkin` texture) and wolf_young.png.\n"},"description":"# wolf\n\nWolf (B6), grey forest wolf, 0.8 m at the shoulder (28.5 u incl. fur), about 1.6 m nose to tail.\n\nLean body (deep chest, narrow waist), dark saddle along the back, pale legs and muzzle, separate jaw, pointed ears, long bushy two-bone tail. A collar cube around the neck is painted as fur in the default texture and as a bead and leather collar in `wolf_runkin`.\n\n- Cubes: 25 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -4.6..4.6, y 0.0..31.5, z -30.0..21.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- body box 8 x 29 x 40 (w x h x d) centred on x = 0, z = -4, from y = 0 (head to z = -30, tail to z = 21)\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3.2 | loop | breathing, looking around |\n| `walk` | 0.8 | loop | 4-beat walk |\n| `trot` | 0.5 | loop | diagonal trot (the travelling gait) |\n| `run` | 0.34 | loop | full gallop, head low |\n| `bite` | 0.8 | once | key 0.32 s: jaws snap shut at full lunge (about 6 u forward); crouch 0.15 s, open 0.26 s |\n| `sit` | 3 | loop | sitting, looking around (loop); howl starts and ends in this pose |\n| `howl` | 3 | once | from sitting: head up 0.6 s, mouth open 1.0-2.2 s (the howl), back to sitting at 3.0 s |\n| `injured` | 0.6 | once | flinch back |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | falls onto its right side, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 49.8 u/s (1.4 m/s), cycle 0.8 s, 40 u per cycle\n- `trot`: 113.8 u/s (3.2 m/s), cycle 0.5 s, 57 u per cycle\n- `run`: 320.0 u/s (9.0 m/s), cycle 0.34 s, 109 u per cycle\n\n## Key times\n\n- `bite`: key 0.32 s: jaws snap shut at full lunge (about 6 u forward); crouch 0.15 s, open 0.26 s\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `wolf_runkin.png`: Runkin friendly wolf: same fur plus a leather collar with red and bone-white beads\n- `wolf_young.png`: young texture (use at half scale): pup, softer and lighter, bigger-looking eyes\n\n## Notes\n\n- Variant file names: wolf_runkin.png (the brief's `wolf_runkin` texture) and wolf_young.png.\n","resolution":{"width":64,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"chest","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4.0,14.5,-14.0],"to":[4.0,26.0,-4.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,21.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[40,14,48.0,25.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[20,14,30.0,25.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[48,14,56.0,25.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[30,14,40.0,25.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[15,27,23.0,37.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[23,27,31.0,37.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"86a76edb-8e27-5d5a-a855-0c5257a005a7"},{"name":"belly","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-3.5,16.5,-5.0],"to":[3.5,25.0,9.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,21.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[28,39,35.0,47.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,39,14.0,47.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[35,39,42.0,47.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[14,39,28.0,47.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,7.0,14.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[7,0,14.0,14.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"b718b9f4-f054-5ccf-ba69-a5716a57a0ab"},{"name":"hips","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-3.5,16.5,8.0],"to":[3.5,25.0,14.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"